          "filename": "Palm Springs is a desert city in Riverside County, California, within the Coachella Valley - USA - January 2010 - Patrick Nouhailler (5775698419).jpg",
          "caption": "Located in the Coachella Valley desert region, Palm Springs is sheltered by the San Bernardino Mountains to the north, the Santa Rosa Mountains to the south, by the San Jacinto Mountains to the west and by the Little San Bernardino Mountains to the east. This geography gives Palm Springs its hot, dry climate, with 354 days of sunshine and only 5.23 inches of rain annually.[",
